    "Particles are mapped to data-free vanilla particles (no new particle types without a client mod).",
    "Only the brightness material channel exists (display brightness); opacity, tint and texture frames are left out.",
    "Wheels, seats and attaching a player are not built for Minecraft.",
  ],
};
EOF
